From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:05:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mac80211_hwsim: report the multi-radio flag in
 GET_RADIO

append_radio_msg() puts HWSIM_ATTR_MULTI_RADIO when the parameters of
the radio have multi_radio set, but mac80211_hwsim_get_radio() never
sets it. The new radio notification reports the flag, while
HWSIM_CMD_GET_RADIO does not report it for a multi-radio wiphy.

Report the flag when the wiphy has wiphy radios, which hwsim registers
only for a multi-radio wiphy.

Fixes: d2601e34a102 ("wifi: mac80211_hwsim: add support for multi-radio wiphy")
Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/virtual/mac80211_hwsim_main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/virtual/mac80211_hwsim_main.c
@@ -7106,6 +7106,7 @@ static int mac80211_hwsim_get_radio(stru
 	param.nan_device = !!(data->hw->wiphy->interface_modes &
 					BIT(NL80211_IFTYPE_NAN));
 	param.use_chanctx = data->use_chanctx;
+	param.multi_radio = data->hw->wiphy->n_radio > 0;
 	param.regd = data->regd;
 	param.channels = data->channels;
 	param.hwname = wiphy_name(data->hw->wiphy);
